Package: marestrata
Type: Package
Title: MareStrata: Ocean Climate Layers Through the Water Column
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jorge", "Assis", email = "jorgemfa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: MareStrata provides ocean climate layers through the water
    column, extending Bio-ORACLE across depth and individual Earth System
    Models. Query the catalog and open matching tiled GeoTIFFs with terra
    from a local directory or over HTTPS. A longitude and latitude extent
    is read as a window, so only that region is transferred.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://biodiversitydatascience.com
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: terra
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
